1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,679
Points zero point four metres apart are a quarter wavelength apart, so the phase difference is pi by two.

2
00:00:06,679 --> 00:00:12,643
The wave takes zero point four over four hundred, one millisecond, to cover that gap.

3
00:00:12,643 --> 00:00:16,406
That is exactly a quarter of the period, as it should be.

